# Build output and artifacts (binaries, disk images, screenshots, logs).
# Anchored to the repo root: `build/` (unanchored) also matched the SOURCE dirs
# scripts/build/ and tools/build/, silently hiding tracked-source tooling
# (ed25519_host.py / write_envelope.py / build_probe.ps1) from `git add` — which
# broke CI's Ed25519 eval with ModuleNotFoundError. Only the root output dir is
# an artifact dir.
/build/

