# Quantum build-diversity seed. Do not commit the raw bytes or provenance.
# Once compiled into a distributed kernel image the value is observable, so it
# is not a runtime secret or a replacement for fresh per-boot entropy.
# tools/quantum/qrng_seed.py + requirements.txt ARE tracked; generated outputs
# are not. build/qrng_seed.inc is already covered by build/ above.
tools/quantum/seed.bin
tools/quantum/seed.inc
tools/quantum/qrng_commitment.txt
tools/quantum/qrng_manifest.txt
src/include/qrng_seed.inc
